Package: matra
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sunjil <35988291+wrsunjil@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/wrsunjil/matra-keyboard
Description: Ultra-fast native Bangla & English keyboard
 Matra (মাত্রা) is an ultra-fast, lightweight native Bangla & English
 system-wide keyboard written in Pure Rust with zero bloatware.
 Features accurate conjunct handling, per-window mode, and silent operation.
